// hunny_horror_arena — the Hunny Horror's room (`docs/planning/game/bosses.md`,
// "The Hunny Horror"). Reached from the Hall of Bosses gallery, through the
// door that led to the Exploding Gradient (retired 2026-10-14).
//
// Behaviour + encounter are data-authored:
//   assets/data/boss_profiles.ron                   (the pattern: which move, when)
//   assets/data/boss_encounters/hunny_horror_boss.ron (HP/phases/music)
// and his conductor (`ambition_content_modules::hunny`) walks him and performs
// the moves.
//
// A wide room, because the fight's long punish window is his charge: he runs
// the floor on all fours and cannot stop, and hits the wall. Two refuges from
// it, one by each wall: a LEDGE above his lowered head (floor - 208; the ram
// tops out at floor - 143), reached from a STEP (floor - 112), which the ram
// does reach. A ledge is also out of his honey puddles and his belly flop's
// shock, but not out of his enraged roar.
//
//   |▓ceiling▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓|
//   |                                                            |
//   |░ledge░░░                                         ░░░ledge░|
//   |          ░step░                          ░step░            |
//   |[door] @                           BEAR                     |
//   |▓floor▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓|
